    "body": "# Appify 0.2.0\n\nEnterprise web-to-native desktop application bundler and cross-platform desktop packager powered by Tauri 2.0.\n\n### Highlights\n- Instant web application wrapping with high-performance native webview execution\n- Cross-platform packaging support for Linux (.deb, AppImage), macOS (.dmg, app bundles), and Windows (.msi, .exe)\n- Hardware acceleration and native OS window chrome integrations\n- Minimal binary overhead and zero runtime background bloat\n",
